251
00:19:21,242 --> 00:19:28,295
Do Exercise 9.2, Level 1, "fold a fix into
the commit it belongs to", and Exercise

252
00:19:28,335 --> 00:19:35,562
9.6, Level 2, "a merge inside the branch",
both in exercises/m06-m10-integration.md.

253
00:19:35,902 --> 00:19:40,926
Today you let four assistants write the todo
list, and you know what each one leaves

254
00:19:40,966 --> 00:19:44,182
for you. Practise the fixup
lab before the next video.

255
00:19:44,222 --> 00:19:48,402
